        "description": "Ingest a new draft case from a scenario, from an existing case, or from a raw packet.\n\n`clone_from` names a case already in the store to seed this one from, and `volunteer_id`\nthe advocate to hand it to. That pair is what the data lab uses to add a case to the\ncaseload without inventing one: the copy keeps the source's scenario, so it still runs the\nway the source does, but every id and deadline on it is its own.",
        "operationId": "create_case_v1_cases_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
