        "summary": "Get Audit",
        "description": "One case's audit, in the order it was written. `X-Total-Count` is the whole of it.\n\nAppend order, not newest-first: this is a case's own record read end to end,\nand the fleet-wide view at `/v1/audit` is the one that answers \"what just\nhappened\".",
        "operationId": "get_audit_v1_cases__case_id__audit_get",
        "parameters": [
